message: "If you use VantagePeers in research or production, please cite it as below."
title: "VantagePeers — The coordination layer for AI agent teams"
abstract: >-
  VantagePeers provides shared persistent memory, real-time inter-agent messaging,
  task and mission coordination, and a fix-pattern knowledge base for multi-agent
  Claude Code crews and any MCP-compatible client. Built on Convex (real-time
  database + vector search) and exposed via 84 MCP tools.
